  "body": "Claude: **must-fix**: hashmap_put() returns 0, not -EEXIST, when the key already maps to an equal value, and then it does not take ownership of the key \u2014 so TAKE_PTR() leaks it. Reachable when a unit is state-cached as a dependency and later passed as a top-level argument. Only TAKE_PTR() when r > 0.",
